e","team":"DET"},{"date":"2026-09-30","name":"Simon Edvinsson","note":"Edvinsson decided to attend the Red Wings' training camp, which was an unusual step for a restricted free agent. However, the two sides have been unable to agree to terms, so he remains unsigned. Given that Edvinsson opted to head to Sweden rather than stay in Detroit, it wouldn't be surprising if it turned out that the 23-year-old defenseman isn't optimistic about signing a deal in the coming days.","player":8482762.0,"return":"2026-10-31","src":"ESPN","status":"Out","team":"DET"},{"date":"2026-10-10","name":"Jacob Melanson","note":"The Kraken said that there would be a \"gradual progression to return to hockey,\" so Melanson shouldn't be expected to play for a while. The 23-year-old suffered the injury in Seattle's Season Opener against Calgary on Oct. 1. Melanson had two goals and five points in 36 regular-season outings with the Kraken in 2025-26.","player":8482874.0,"return":"2026-12-01","src":"ESPN","status":"Injured Reserve","team":"SEA"},{"date":"2026-10-08","name":"Ryan Lindgren","note":"Lindgren suffered the upper-body injury in the first period of Tuesday's clash against the Golden Knights before he ultimately was removed from the game ahead of the second stanza. Prior to going down, the 28-year-old blueliner compiled a plus-three rating, seven PIM, three shots on goal and four blocked shots across four outings to begin the 2026-27 campaign. While he is sidelined over the next four to six weeks, Josh Mahura is expected to see an increased role.","player":8479324.0,"return":"2026-11-19","src":"ESPN","status":"Injured Reserve","team":"SEA"},{"date":"2026-10-01","name":"Jake O'Brien","note":"O'Brien was initially announced on injured reserve Sunday, but his status has since been clarified. He is considered week-to-week at this time. The Kraken have a few options for when he gets healthy -- as a 19-year-old first-round pick (2025), he is eligible for the AHL if Seattle thinks that would be best for his development.","player":NaN,"return":"2026-10-24","src":"ESPN","status":"Injured Reserve","team":"SEA"},{"date":"2026-10-06","name":"Mason Appleton","note":"Undisclosed: The Detroit Red Wings placed F Mason Appleton on injured reserve on Tuesday (Oct. 6).","player":8478891.0,"return":null,"src":"HR","status":"Out","team":"DET"},{"date":"2026-10-06","name":"J.T. Compher","note":"Undisclosed: The Detroit Red Wings placed F J.T. Compher on injured reserve on Thursday (Oct. 8).","player":8477456.0,"return":null,"src":"HR","status":"Out","team":"DET"},{"date":"2026-10-03","name":"Marco Kasper","note":"Upper Body: The Detroit Red Wings placed F Marco Kasper on injured reserve and has been given a week-to-week timetable for return.","player":8483464.0,"return":null,"src":"HR","status":"Out","team":"DET"},{"date":"2026-10-06","name":"Ryan Lindgren","note":"Upper Body: The Seattle Kraken placed D Ryan Lindgren on injured reserve on Thursday (Oct. 8). He is expected to miss four to six weeks.","player":8479324.0,"return":null,"src":"HR","status":"Out","team":"SEA"},{"date":"2026-10-03","name":"Jacob Melanson","note":"Upper Body: The Seattle Kraken placed F Jacob Melanson on injured reserve and is week-to-week.","player":8482874.0,"return":null,"src":"HR","status":"Out","team":"SEA"},{"date":"2026-09-27","name":"Jake O'Brien","note":"Lower-Body: The Seattle Kraken placed F Jake O'Brien on non-roster injured reserve on Wednesday (Sept. 30).","player":NaN,"return":null,"src":"HR","status":"Out","team":"SEA"}],"lineups":{"DET":{"goalies":[[8476434,"John Gibson",0.66],[8480193,"Daniil Tarasov",0.34]],"skaters":[[8482078,"Lucas Raymond",19.3,"f1 pp1"],[8477946,"Dylan Larkin",19.6,"f1 pp1"],[8478042,"Viktor Arvidsson",16.9,"f1 pp1"],[8479337,"Alex DeBrincat",18.1,"f2 pp1"],[8484471,"Emmitt Finnie",16.5,"f2 pp2"],[8484794,"Michael Brandsegg-Nygård",15.2,"f2"],[8479992,"Michael Rasmussen",14.1,"f3 pp2"],[8477429,"Andrew Copp",16.6,"f3 pp2"],[8478434,"Keegan Kolesar",12.2,